cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "GeoPres"
type: software
version: 0.1.3
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/konstantinoskalyfommatos/geopres"
abstract: >-
  GeoPres learns a single linear map that reduces the dimensionality of text
  embeddings while preserving pairwise Euclidean distances, and evaluates it
  against PCA, random projection, random selection, truncation and
  autoencoder baselines on MTEB.
